# Build context hygiene — sources go in, artifacts and junk stay out.
# dist/ is rebuilt inside the image so stale host builds can't leak in.
.git
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
# The desktop shell's deployed server tree (MX3) — a local build artifact, and
# one whose native modules are built for Electron's ABI. Never in an image.
apps/desktop/server-runtime
**/.turbo
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
design
prototype
Dockerfile
docker-compose*.yml
